<title>USA: Freddie Mac to redeem $15 mln debenture issue.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac to redeem $15 mln debenture issue.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp said Friday that on March 25 it will redeem the entire $15 million principal amount of its 7.705 percent debenture issue due to mature March 9, 2000.</p>
<p>The cusip number for the debentures is 3134003R2. Freddie Mac said the issue will be redeemed at a price equal to 100 percent of the principal amount.</p>
<p>Payment of principal plus interest accrued to the redemption date will be made to shareholders of record as of the close of business on March 24, Freddie Mac said.</p>
</text>
